## Greetings: a small library that the xetal doc tests document.

### Saying hello

## The greeting for a name.
## >> "g:" u_se< "Greet"
## >> g:h_ello "Ann"
## Hello, Ann
l:h_ello := { n -> "Hello, " c_at n }

## A greeting shouted.
##
## It reuses the plain greeting.
## >> "g:" u_se< "Greet"
## >> g:s_hout "Bo"
## Hello, Bo!
## >> g:count
## 2
l:s_hout := { n -> (l:h_ello n) c_at mark }

### Values

# A private helper: not exported, and its comment is plain.
mark := "!"

## How many greetings there are.
l:count := 2
